    "title": "第7章 歴史の蹄跡を歩む夏",
    "enTitle": "Chapter 7: A Summer Walking in the Footsteps of History",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "それは夏合宿前のこと。\nクロノジェネシスに休養日の過ごし方について聞いたところ――",
            "enText": "This happened before the summer training camp. When I asked Chrono Genesis how she wanted to spend her day off ——",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 98,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "行きたいところがあるんだ？",
                    "enText": "Is there somewhere you want to go?",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 151,
                    "pathId": 559601231410609596
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2377646220654400179,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "は、はい……。合宿所から電車で日帰りできる場所に\nレース場の跡地があるんです……。",
            "enText": "Y-Yes… There's the site of a former racecourse… \nlocated a day trip away by train from the training camp…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 233,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 181,
                    "pathId": 6240977898334889491
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 4900241067997931844
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3586298666140287527,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "ずっと昔に廃止になってしまったのですが、\n数々の勝負が行なわれており……以前から興味があって……。",
            "enText": "It was abandoned a long time ago, but countless matches were held there… I've been interested in it for a while now…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 293,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 224,
                    "pathId": -6345921397859879043
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 8817381841632210988
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1456022503060389829,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "それで……あの……。えっと……。\n………………。",
            "enText": "And so…… um…… well…… \n………………",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 247,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 181,
                    "pathId": -1264752506856876435
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4152795821818408606,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "と、トレーナーさん。\n一緒に……いかがでしょうか……？",
            "enText": "T-Trainer. \nWould you… like to come with me…?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 182,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "俺もいいのか？",
                    "enText": "Is it okay if I come along?",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "私もいいの？",
                    "enText": "Is it okay if I come along?",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 238,
                    "pathId": 8715338517657848934
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 8039826030672318140
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4389150083742988695,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "は、はいっ。その、今はなにもない場所ですが……。\n歴史的に見て、大変意義のある場所だと思いますし……！",
            "enText": "Y-Yes. Um, there's nothing there now, but… From a historical perspective, I believe it's a very significant place…!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 292,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "いいね、一緒に行こっか",
                    "enText": "Sounds good, let's go together",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 258,
                    "pathId": 5915715847469311719
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 2057466480696596201
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4170035405289430049,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "――……！　は、はい……！",
            "enText": "——…! Y-Yes…!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 122,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 6275403852600249772
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6707736024790845308,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そして夏合宿の休養日。",
            "enText": "And so, on the summer training camp's day off.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 59,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -8229861852359954599
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 122,
                    "pathId": -8227061693517832980
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 163,
                    "pathId": 425219145537721301
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9113768414636761796,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "あ、あの……よろしければこちらをどうぞ。\nレジュメです……これから行くレース場の。",
            "enText": "U-Um… If you'd like, please take a look at this. \nIt's a summary… of the racecourse we're going to.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 292,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 96,
                    "pathId": -8912991649468936931
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 5223271292986314273
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4362597045538044127,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "レース場の成り立ちや、レース結果がまとめてあります。\nその……調べられたところだけ、ですけど……。",
            "enText": "It summarizes the history of the racecourse and its race results. Well… Only the part I was able to find, though…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 296,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "これ、クロノがまとめてくれたのか？",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Did you put all this together yourself, Chrono?</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "これ、クロノがまとめてくれたの？",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Did you put all this together yourself, Chrono?</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 248,
                    "pathId": -6465171360211176671
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 1381424865967555087
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8021903030453922,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "は、はい……！　予備知識があったほうが、\nトレーナーさんも楽しめるかな？　と、思いまして……。",
            "enText": "Y-Yes…! I thought that having some background knowledge… \nmight make it more enjoyable for you, Trainer…",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 234,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ありがとう、すごく助かるよ！",
                    "enText": "Thank you, this helps a lot!",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 248,
                    "pathId": -2804014232570793983
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 281,
                    "pathId": 8140252775214051257
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2443062908263586083,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "本当ですか……！？\n…………よかった……。",
            "enText": "Really…!? \n…………I'm glad…",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 205,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 187,
                    "pathId": -2124515731463807711
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 73,
                    "pathId": -734909649735080493
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3628236475190201737,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "あ……電車が来るまで、まだ時間がありますね。\n私、飲み物、買ってきます。",
            "enText": "Ah… We still have some time before the train arrives. \nI'll go buy us some drinks.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 248,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -6680141550486020054
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5199131117643976780
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4729328030972888854,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "目的地の駅を降り、草の香りが漂うあぜ道を進む。\nただ、歩くだけではつまらないので――",
            "enText": "After getting off at our destination, we walk along a narrow path filled with the scent of grass. Since just walking would be boring—",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "じゃーんけーん……チョキ！",
                    "enText": "Rock, paper… scissors!",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2058076974926605316,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "あっ……私の勝ちです……！\nえっと……ぐー、れー、えー、どー、れー、えー……す。",
            "enText": "Ah… I win…! \nLet's see… G- R- A- D- E- R- A- C- E-…tsu.",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 324,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 17,
                    "pathId": -6369122224888726907
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3571309128045701036,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……ふふっ。\n追いつ追われつ、競り合いですね……！",
            "enText": "…Hehe. \nIt's a neck-and-neck race……!",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 185,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（クロノ、はしゃいでるなぁ）",
                    "enText": "(Chrono's having a lot of fun)",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -5674231738527087405
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6939364007772362865,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……そうだ。確か、この先に……。\n…………あっ。",
            "enText": "…Oh right. If I recall, up ahead there's… \n…………Ah.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 233,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 34,
                    "pathId": -5843179564709658317
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 19,
                    "pathId": 8325449221913057052
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6085304568699984276,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "トレーナーさん……あっちの神社に寄り道しませんか？\nそこもレースに縁のある場所なんです……。",
            "enText": "Trainer… Would you like to take a detour to that shrine over there? It's a place with ties to racing as well…",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 235,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "じゃあ、先にそこへ着いたほうが勝ちで！",
                    "enText": "Then whoever gets there first wins!",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 103,
                    "pathId": 4427734861379885498
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 19,
                    "pathId": 3130240430554531228
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3020886498955643725,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "くすっ……いいですよ？　このまま逃げ切ってみせますので。\nそれでは――……。",
            "enText": "Hehe… You're on. I'll make sure to keep my lead all the way to the end. Well then…",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 232,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -7718281192512910873
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 245,
                    "pathId": -6212748670422180588
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -288283715503685085,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "じゃんけん…………ぽんっ。",
            "enText": "Rock, paper………… scissors!",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 77,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": 8252991655479225415
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": -8178648477511048568
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6201592964518732372,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "…………ふぅ。",
            "enText": "…………Hah.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 162,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ～、木陰、助かる～……！",
                    "enText": "Aah～ this shade is a lifesaver～…!",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 74,
                    "pathId": 7652770149143593956
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2083168626744501157,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "はい……生き返りますよね。",
            "enText": "Yes… I feel completely revived.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 109,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -8933209412573599586
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 6138562925848577832
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4217985181335773041,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "あ……そうそう。この神社……昔は戦勝祈願で有名だったそうです。\n当時の選手たちはレースに臨む前、必ずお参りしたとか。",
            "enText": "Ah… That's right. This shrine… was apparently famous for prayers of victory in the past. It's said that the runners back then would always come to pray before a race.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 404,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "へえ……！",
                    "enText": "Whoa…!",
                    "nextBlock": 24
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 206,
                    "pathId": -3250994096441342308
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -396862263283860162
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1655258558407146353,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "きっと、賑やかだったのでしょうね……。\n応援の方々もたくさんいらして……。",
            "enText": "I'm sure it must have been bustling… \nWith so many people coming to support them, too…",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 222,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 221,
                    "pathId": 5257619929580701325
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": 7275112613505089155
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4314146578555239148,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "けれど、勝ちたいという願いは現代と変わらなくて……。\n真剣な思いは、私たちと同じで……。",
            "enText": "However, the desire to win hasn't changed since then… \nTheir earnest feelings are just the same as ours…",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 329,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 372,
                    "pathId": 935686032410297067
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -8596461703211317114
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5392192218308555517,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "くすっ……不思議ですね。\n遠い人たちなのに、なんだか身近に感じます……。",
            "enText": "Hehe… It's strange. Even though they're from a distant past, \nI feel somewhat close to them…",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 242,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（俺たちと変わらない……か）",
                    "enText": "(Just the same as us… huh)",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（私たちと変わらない……か）",
                    "enText": "(Just the same as us… huh)",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 307,
                    "pathId": -2071659824037154236
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 260,
                    "pathId": 5331079524229721661
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4058778611452187757,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "それから神社を後にして、再び歩き出す。\n長い長い道を抜けて、ようやく行き着いた先は――",
            "enText": "After that, we left the shrine and started walking again. \nPassing through the long, long path, the place we finally arrived at was ——",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": -2183918636147661180
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 17,
                    "pathId": 8566915647053987896
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2313096862920224724,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "…………何もなかった。\nいや、正確に言えば小さな記念碑があるだけだ。",
            "enText": "…………Nothing. \nOr rather, to be more accurate, there was just a small memorial monument.",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 89,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -7688814110514659967,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "…………すみません。\nその、想定以上に……シンプルな史跡でしたね……。",
            "enText": "…………I'm sorry. \nUm, this historical site is… much simpler than I expected…",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 321,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "でも、面影は感じられるよ",
                    "enText": "<size=33>But, you can still feel the traces of what it used to be</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 30
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 284,
                    "pathId": -6215133960717003179
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 309,
                    "pathId": 6014144243595424451
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": 7797281285502964620
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5875597028131945102,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "道に沿うように生えた低木……おそらくコースの跡だろう。\n彼女のレジュメのおかげもあって、当時の姿が想像できる。",
            "enText": "The shrubs growing along the path… are probably the remnants of the course. Thanks to her summary, I can imagine what it looked like back then.",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "きっと、あの辺りが最終直線で……",
                    "enText": "<size=36>I bet that area over there was the final straight…</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 31
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": 1868355053784096079
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 7907093532769529165
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8337459914529229516,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
